  {
    "slug": "swemre-website-api",
    "title": "swemre-website-api",
    "excerpt": "The backend of the websites managed from SwePress: a Spring Boot modular monolith with one PostgreSQL schema per module.",
    "tags": [
      "java",
      "spring-boot",
      "postgresql",
      "featured"
    ],
    "publishedAt": "2026-02-02T08:00:00Z",
    "updatedAt": "2026-10-26T08:00:00Z",
    "fields": {
      "status": "source-only",
      "version": "v1.4.0-alpha",
      "year": 2026,
      "language": "Java 25",
      "repoUrl": "https://github.com/swemre/swemre-website-api",
      "docsUrl": "https://github.com/swemre/swemre-website-api/blob/main/docs/modules.md",
      "featured": true,
      "order": 2,
      "hue": "blue",
      "glyph": "API",
      "related": [
        "modular-monolith",
        "spring-boot-template",
        "outbox-events",
        "spring-service-template",
        "swepress"
      ],
      "tagline": "Built from this template"
    },
    "body": [
      {
        "type": "section",
        "props": {
          "number": "0x01",
          "eyebrow": "overview",
          "title": "One backend for every site",
          "hue": "blue",
          "copy": "One account owns any number of workspaces, and every document, media file, collection and channel belongs to exactly one of them."
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "props": {
          "text": "The CMS calls the admin API with a bearer token; each website reads only through the public API of its own channel. The business modules keep their data in PostgreSQL, one schema per module, and uploaded files on disk. Everything ships as one Spring Boot application behind Traefik on a single VPS."
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "facts",
        "props": {
          "layout": "list",
          "facts": [
            {
              "label": "Admin API",
              "value": "/api/v2/workspaces/{id}/…",
              "code": true
            },
            {
              "label": "Public API",
              "value": "/api/public/v2/channels/{key}/…",
              "code": true
            },
            {
              "label": "Sign-in",
              "value": "Password or Google, for the owner"
            },
            {
              "label": "Licence",
              "value": "MIT"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "section",
        "props": {
          "number": "02",
          "eyebrow": "stack",
          "title": "Stack and commands",
          "hue": "sky",
          "copy": "Every check runs locally: one verify build covers Checkstyle and all three test categories."
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "stack",
        "props": {
          "prompt": "cat pom.xml | grep artifactId",
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "Java 25",
              "note": "Records and virtual threads."
            },
            {
              "name": "Spring Boot 4",
              "note": "Web, validation, actuator."
            },
            {
              "name": "PostgreSQL",
              "note": "One schema per module."
            },
            {
              "name": "Flyway",
              "note": "Versioned migrations, never edited."
            },
            {
              "name": "Testcontainers",
              "note": "Unit, component, integration."
            },
            {
              "name": "Checkstyle",
              "note": "Fails the build on any violation."
            },
            {
              "name": "Docker",
              "note": "One production image."
            },
            {
              "name": "Traefik",
              "note": "Routing, TLS, IP allowlist."
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "props": {
          "language": "bash",
          "variant": "terminal",
          "title": "commands",
          "code": "$ docker compose up -d\n$ ./mvnw verify\n$ ./mvnw test -Dtest.category=unit\n$ ./mvnw -pl service -am spring-boot:run"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "section",
        "props": {
          "number": "0b011",
          "eyebrow": "architecture",
          "title": "How a request travels",
          "hue": "peri",
          "copy": "Clients reach Traefik first. The service answers v2 routes after checking the caller’s workspace role, and answers ids of another workspace with 404."
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "image",
        "props": {
          "url": "media:swemre-website-api-architecture-light",
          "darkUrl": "media:swemre-website-api-architecture-dark",
          "alt": "Architecture of swemre-website-api: clients, Traefik, the modular service, storage",
          "card": true
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "section",
        "props": {
          "number": "04L",
          "eyebrow": "history",
          "title": "Releases and links",
          "hue": "lilac",
          "copy": "Newest first. Released migrations and error keys are never changed or reused."
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "links",
        "props": {
          "links": [
            {
              "label": "Repository",
              "value": "swemre/swemre-website-api",
              "href": "https://github.com/swemre/swemre-website-api"
            },
            {
              "label": "Module guide",
              "value": "docs/modules.md",
              "href": "https://github.com/swemre/swemre-website-api/blob/main/docs/modules.md"
            },
            {
              "label": "API reference",
              "value": "/api/v2",
              "href": "https://github.com/swemre/swemre-website-api/blob/main/docs/public-api-v2.md"
            },
            {
              "label": "Changelog",
              "value": "CHANGELOG.md",
              "href": "https://github.com/swemre/swemre-website-api/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "timeline",
        "props": {
          "items": [
            {
              "version": "v1.4.0-alpha",
              "date": "2026-10-26",
              "title": "Google sign-in for the owner",
              "note": "ID tokens for one client id, limited to an allowlist of addresses.",
              "current": true
            },
            {
              "version": "v1.3.0",
              "date": "2026-09-18",
              "title": "Public API v2 per channel",
              "note": "Websites read through their channel key; the old routes are gone."
            },
            {
              "version": "v1.2.0",
              "date": "2026-08-20",
              "title": "Outbox events between modules",
              "note": "Modules publish events in the same transaction as their writes."
            },
            {
              "version": "v1.0.0",
              "date": "2026-06-30",
              "title": "First release",
              "note": "Workspaces, documents and media in one Spring Boot application."
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    ]
